 "subjects": ["CLASS_10A","CLASS_10B"],
 "conditions": [[{"fact":"is_corner_lot","op":"IS_FALSE"},{"fact":"boundary_type","op":"IN","value":["PRIMARY_FRONTAGE","SECONDARY_FRONTAGE_ROAD"]}],[{"fact":"is_corner_lot","op":"IS_TRUE"},{"fact":"average_lot_depth_m","op":">","value":24},{"fact":"boundary_type","op":"IN","value":["PRIMARY_FRONTAGE","SECONDARY_FRONTAGE_ROAD"]}],[{"fact":"is_corner_lot","op":"IS_TRUE"},{"fact":"average_lot_depth_m","op":"<=","value":24},{"fact":"boundary_type","op":"=","value":"PRIMARY_FRONTAGE"}]],
 "sources": [{"key":"lsc_ldr_lmdr_twp_front_class10a","role":"PRIMARY","quote":"All lot sizes ... Circumstance (A): If the lot is not a corner lot, buildings or structures have a setback from road frontage boundaries in accordance with the following: ... (d) a standalone Class 10a building under the Building Code of Australia being a shed, garage or carport has a setback of at least six (6) metres; and (e) any other building or structure has a setback of at least six (6) metres."},{"key":"lsc_ldr_lmdr_twp_front_corner_class10a","role":"SUPPLEMENTARY","quote":"(a) if the ‘depth of a lot’ has an average of greater than twenty-four (24) metres: ... (iv) a standalone Class 10a buildings under the Building Code of Australia being a shed, garage or carport has a setback of at least six (6) metres; (v) any other building or structure has a setback of at least six (6) metres; ... (b) if the ‘depth of a lot’ has an average of twenty-four (24) metres or less: (i) for the ‘primary road frontage’: ... (D) a standalone Class 10a buildings under the Building Code of Australia being a shed, garage or carport has a setback of at least six (6) metres; (E) any other building or structure has a setback of at least six (6) metres;"}],
 "interpretation_notes": "Items (d) standalone Class 10a shed/garage/carport and (e) any other building or structure (both 6 m); the dwelling (3 m), decks/patios/pergolas (3 m) and attached-garage rows are outside the Class 10 scope. Non-corner lots and corner lots deeper than 24 m: all road frontages; corner lot with average depth <= 24 m: primary road frontage only - the secondary frontage limb (b)(ii) refers to Figure SC10.1.6 and was not transcribed, so the QDC stays in play there. The 9 m x 9 m corner truncation (no building or structure over 2 m) is a geometric limit for the geometry layer. Exemptions: <= 2 m structures (LSC.C.SCH10_LOW_STRUCTURE_FRONT_EXEMPT), small gatehouse/arch (LSC.C.SCH10_GATEHOUSE_FRONT_EXEMPT); open carport concession: LSC.C.LDR_LMDR_TWP_OPEN_CARPORT_FRONT. Pools are not named; an in-ground pool under 2 m outermost projection height is exempt.",
 "effective_from": "2025-05-02"}$r$);
