 "sources": [{"key":"lsc_seaspray_comrec_front","role":"PRIMARY","quote":"AO5.1 Buildings or structures (other than fences) have a setback from road frontage lot boundaries in accordance with the following: ... (c) where located in the Seaspray Community and Recreation Precinct and the lot does not have an approved building location envelope: (i) a setback from any road frontage lot boundary of at least six (6) metres."}],
